OL,3,GNEWSAVerdicts being delivered in
OL,4,AHuntingdon train attacker attempted
OL,5,Amurder trial
OL,6,
OL,7,FJurors are returning their verdicts in
OL,8,Fthe trial of a knifeman accused of
OL,9,Fattempting to murder 10 people on a
OL,10,FLondon-bound train
OL,12,FAnthony Williams, 33, stabbed 10 people
OL,13,Fbetween Peterborough and Huntingdon,
OL,14,FCambridgeshire, on an LNER service on 1
OL,15,FNovember 2025
OL,17,FHe denies the charges of attempted
OL,18,Fmurder on the train but has admitted 10
OL,19,Fcounts of wounding with intent to cause
OL,20,Freally serious bodily harm
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
