OL,3,GNEWSAVerdicts being delivered in
OL,4,AHuntingdon train attacker attempted
OL,5,Amurder trial
OL,6,
OL,7,FDuring the trial, one victim said he
OL,8,Fsuspected the attack was a "joke" but
OL,9,Flater asked hospital staff "am I going
OL,10,Fto die today?"
OL,12,FPassengers and an LNER staff member
OL,13,Fsaid they used various objects -
OL,14,Fincluding a frying pan, walking frame
OL,15,Fand toaster - to defend themselves
OL,17,FWilliams has separately pleaded not
OL,18,Fguilty to the attempted murders of
OL,19,Fthree people in Peterborough and a boy
OL,20,Fin London prior to the LNER attack
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
